1.1.0
- Expand the effect library from 6 to 16 modes.
- Add Police Lights, Heartbeat, Candle Flicker, Lightning Storm, Radiation Glitch,
  SOS Beacon, Plasma Shift, Rapid Strobe, Power Surge, and Pip-Boy Boot.
- Reduce animation-time allocations for better persistent-mode memory stability.
- Restore firmware lighting correctly after sleep and when resetting to default.

1.0.0
- Add HAMCo LED as a packaged Pip-Boy app with metadata, README, ChangeLog, and install storage entries.
